      "h": 0.5,
      "text": "上电（开电源开关）",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#16A34A",
        "line": "#15803D",
        "line_weight_pt": 1.5,
        "text_color": "#FFFFFF",
        "font_family": "Microsoft YaHei UI",
        "font_size_pt": 11,
        "font_weight": "bold"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "power_mgmt",
      "type": "process_box",
      "x": 1.25,
      "y": 1.25,
      "w": 4.5,
      "h": 1.15,
      "text": "电源管理子电路启动\nVCCBAT → A1117-3.3 → 3.3V\nMCU 上电复位（POR）",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#EFF6FF",
        "line": "#3B82F6",
        "line_weight_pt": 1.8,
        "text_color": "#1E3A5F",
        "font_family": "Microsoft YaHei UI",
        "font_size_pt": 10,
        "rounding_in": 0.06
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bootloader",
      "type": "process_box",
      "x": 1.25,
      "y": 2.85,
      "w": 4.5,
      "h": 0.8,
      "text": "启动 Bootloader（依 BOOT0）\nBOOT0 = 0 → 从 Flash 启动",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#F0FDF4",
        "line": "#22C55E",
        "line_weight_pt": 1.8,
        "text_color": "#14532D",
        "font_family": "Microsoft YaHei UI",
        "font_size_pt": 10,
        "rounding_in": 0.06
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "main_init",
      "type": "process_box",
      "x": 1.25,
      "y": 4.1,
      "w": 4.5,
      "h": 2.55,
      "text": "main() 执行外设初始化\n─────────────────────────\nRCC / SysTick / GPIO\nTIM4 → PWM 输出（PB6/7/8/9）\nPA11 / PA12 → 上拉输入（红外）\nPA15 → 上拉输入（启动按键）\nPA9 / PA10 → USART1 调试串口\nPB14/PB15 → 超声波 GPIO + TIM2\nPB10/PB11 → I²C2，初始化 CJ-M49\n执行 200 ms 加速度计零偏校准",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#EFF6FF",
        "line": "#2563EB",
        "line_weight_pt": 1.8,
        "text_color": "#1E3A5F",
        "font_family": "Microsoft YaHei UI",
        "font_size_pt": 9.5,
        "rounding_in": 0.06
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wait_key",
      "type": "decision_diamond",
      "x": 1.8,
      "y": 7.1,
      "w": 3.4,
      "h": 1.0,
      "text": "等待按键按下\nKey_GetNum() != 0 ?",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#FFF7ED",
        "line": "#F97316",
        "line_weight_pt": 1.8,
        "text_color": "#7C2D12",
        "font_family": "Microsoft YaHei UI",
        "font_size_pt": 9.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "main_loop",
      "type": "process_box",
      "x": 1.25,
      "y": 8.55,
      "w": 4.5,
      "h": 0.85,
      "text": "进入主控制循环\nwhile(1)  {  感知 → 决策 → 执行  }",
      "style": {
        "fill": "#F0FDF4",
        "line": "#16A34A",
        "line_weight_pt": 1.8,
        "text_color": "#14532D",
        "font_family": "Microsoft YaHei UI",
        "font_size_pt": 10,
        "rounding_in": 0.06
      }
    }
  ],
